SUMMARY:C&O Canal Hike
DESCRIPTION:Metrotrails: NJ\, PA\, NY Metropolitan Area Hiking and More!\n
 Join us for this point to point hike on the Chesapeake and Ohio Canal.\nWe
  will meet at 9 am at the Billy Goat/Anglers Trail B lot of Potomac Maryla
 nd\, across from Old Angler's Inn. We shuttle with as few cars as possible
  west to do a 15 mile section that includes a side trip to the Great Falls
 .\nMost of this is flat and easy\, but note that we pass no stores on the 
 way.\nEveryone must come prepared with all of the food and water they need
 .\nThis is day 1 of 2\, the second of which will be Monday morning to comp
 lete the route to Washington DC.\nIf needed\, contact me at \,908 343 8374
